# Tauri shell (apps/desktop): npm deps, the UI bundle, Rust output, and the ACL
# schemas tauri-build regenerates on every compile. The Tauri lockfile is the
# one npm regenerates in apps/desktop; the ROOT package-lock.json is published
# on purpose — `npm ci` in the engine and macOS jobs installs from it — so it
# must NOT be ignored.
